                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "494c6e25-a270-42e7-8882-224db9eeaa74",
                        "entry_id": "31694134-8d17-39fd-9bfb-824381c5968a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "symptomatiques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a50330d-b894-379d-a0af-bc932b644af6",
                        "entry_id": "31694134-8d17-39fd-9bfb-824381c5968a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est un symptôme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a59c8c8d-b76b-4cb3-b4c2-eac1cff65aa0",
                                "sense_id": "4a50330d-b894-379d-a0af-bc932b644af6",
                                "text": "L'auteur expose que la gémellarité par elle-même ne semble pas prédisposer d'une façon particulière à l’épilepsie. Comme on l'observe chez les épileptiques en général, l’épilepsie des jumeaux est très fréquemment symptomatique de malformations ou d'altérations cérébrales ([…])."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "282b3650-88d0-3c2f-b30d-0ecdba308775",
                        "entry_id": "31694134-8d17-39fd-9bfb-824381c5968a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui traite ou réduit un symptôme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c7a146e-631d-4bd5-84e6-f7460dbcc94f",
                                "sense_id": "282b3650-88d0-3c2f-b30d-0ecdba308775",
                                "text": "À l’heure actuelle, les traitements sont uniquement symptomatiques, mais permettent de stabiliser 70% des patients."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4823ce96-b7de-34ab-be25-39510ed8a686",
                        "entry_id": "31694134-8d17-39fd-9bfb-824381c5968a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui relève, qui fait ressortir, qui met en valeur un trouble organique ou fonctionnel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b381b43-0a36-435e-a87e-588d434c1e79",
                                "sense_id": "4823ce96-b7de-34ab-be25-39510ed8a686",
                                "text": "La confusion avec la France insoumise est d’ailleurs symptomatique de l’effacement qu’il est en train de vivre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a1f5fc1-dca2-4b6a-b9d5-849f1eabc090",
                                "sense_id": "4823ce96-b7de-34ab-be25-39510ed8a686",
                                "text": "Une absence symptomatique des querelles qui traversent cette famille recomposée."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cde34f24-a63e-41f3-a263-811350e6dfdd",
                        "source_entry_id": "31694134-8d17-39fd-9bfb-824381c5968a",
                        "target_lang_word": "symptomatic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "symptomatic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d446c2b-0925-3ddf-ac8f-b53a0c8ef924",
                                        "entry_id": "75ed6f77-c58c-350a-88ba-f801068c0123",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Showing symptoms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f30be206-f098-4196-a9cc-7457e2302174",
                                                "sense_id": "5d446c2b-0925-3ddf-ac8f-b53a0c8ef924",
                                                "text": "It is important to observe symptomatic cats out of the carrier, on the floor in a safe, escape-proof room. Swelling, heat, and pain in one or more joints can explain many signs, including lameness, malaise, and fever."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be855a45-e428-37cc-ac6a-8d6b5423fa80",
                                        "entry_id": "75ed6f77-c58c-350a-88ba-f801068c0123",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Constituting a symptom or indication; characteristic, indicative."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "327fea8a-6e87-4d12-b405-17f1de17f4e0",
                                                "sense_id": "be855a45-e428-37cc-ac6a-8d6b5423fa80",
                                                "text": "The city's problems are symptomatic of the crisis that is spreading throughout the country."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54db9ab4-ad12-4a5c-b384-51b23052570a",
                                                "sense_id": "be855a45-e428-37cc-ac6a-8d6b5423fa80",
                                                "text": "Symptomatic of a shallow understanding and an unamiable temper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "430b2082-1591-40fa-b06f-4c8efbc1f75a",
                                                "sense_id": "be855a45-e428-37cc-ac6a-8d6b5423fa80",
                                                "text": "And it is symptomatic of the many paradoxes of Lederer's life that of all the people in the room, Brotherhood is the one whom he would most wish to serve, if ever he had the opportunity, even though — or perhaps because — his occasional efforts to ingratiate himself with his adopted hero have met with iron rebuff."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f632d04-c9ae-3b35-a61d-91a238dfb5cc",
                                        "entry_id": "75ed6f77-c58c-350a-88ba-f801068c0123",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a treatment, that only affects the symptoms of a disease without targeting the underlying cause."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14ed4903-104c-34a1-97fb-32627a91aa3d",
